T Tan clip lever
# A connector on an axle spins freely. A tan clip locks it to the rod so the two turn together:
# that is how a motor drives something instead of the axle just spinning inside the hub.
! post and axle
C P1 W8 -2,0,0.5 x y
C T1 W8 -2,0,2.5 x y
R P1 T1
C P2 W8 2,0,0.5 x y
C T2 W8 2,0,2.5 x y
R P2 T2
R -2.828,0,2.5 2.828,0,2.5 grey
C CL D1 -2.828,0,2.5 y x
C CR D1 2.828,0,2.5 y -x
! the lever, locked to the axle
H LV W8 0,0,2.5 z
P -0.2,0,2.5 silver
P 0.2,0,2.5 silver
L LV
C LT W8 0,2,2.5 z x
R LV LT
W bob LT mass=60
